<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese money supply rose 8.9 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Portuguese money supply rose 8.9 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese money supply, as measured by &quot;aggregate 'L,&quot; roughly equivalent to M3, rose 8.9 percent year-on-year in November, compared with 7.9 percent in the previous month, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>Domestic bank lending grew 8.5 percent year-on-year, compared with 8.0 percent the previous month.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
